{"title":"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/a/1ca16383129aebb061bb0e345327dff7fbc71548.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac 2{\\log_4{2000^6}} + \\frac 3{\\log_5{2000^6}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"184\" height=\"42\" /></center>\n<p>can be written as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/9/9b9ffa9646e74f6e94a4a66b824c3a3f08f4f4b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac mn$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"18\" height=\"33\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are relatively prime positive integers.  Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/b/53bf1afcb274a3bb84338109fffec8a1f1c02008.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m + n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/a/1ca16383129aebb061bb0e345327dff7fbc71548.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac 2{\\log_4{2000^6}} + \\frac 3{\\log_5{2000^6}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"184\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/3/6235bf2665379d3bdc350b4997939790aa266053.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{\\log_4{16}}{\\log_4{2000^6}}+\\frac{\\log_5{125}}{\\log_5{2000^6}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"203\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/8/758a4c435d85c414dbf48bcadb8ec985d3d8fbd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{\\log{16}}{\\log{2000^6}}+\\frac{\\log{125}}{\\log{2000^6}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"188\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/d/d0d45dc7eed030345c3b4d7d616b91bf2f16cb78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{\\log{2000}}{\\log{2000^6}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"91\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/9/3099de259e761de509aa4ced47ba23edf76a63d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{\\log{2000}}{6\\log{2000}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"96\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/c/bcc4ac57a2d44764225fd56f9b259a47e60b1bb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{1}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"30\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/8/318f26357b3f9aaada2b91c14e1d5c56a6c98cd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n=1+6=\\boxed{007}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"177\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Alternatively, we could've noted that, because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/3/a43ed6ee8d6f27a213477280edd069bbf8b212b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac 1{\\log_a{b}} = \\log_b{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"115\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/3/1e3ee0edab47c500ca79dcb1318b64f9706cdad0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac 2{\\log_4{2000^6}} + \\frac 3{\\log_5{2000^6}} &amp;= 2 \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\log_4{2000^6}} + 3\\cdot \\frac {1}{\\log_5{2000^6} }\\\\ &amp;=2{\\log_{2000^6}{4}} + 3{\\log_{2000^6}{5}} \\\\ &amp;={\\log_{2000^6}{4^2}} + {\\log_{2000^6}{5^3}}\\\\ &amp;={\\log_{2000^6}{4^2 \\cdot 5^3}}\\\\ &amp;={\\log_{2000^6}{2000}}\\\\ &amp;= {\\frac{1}{6}}.\\end{align*}\" width=\"436\" height=\"191\" />\n</p><p>Therefore our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/9/6996cb9c46c9ea4b8e4ce4be1bed206746ae39b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 6 = \\boxed{007}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"105\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/c/e5ca95fa8d2ac86ec54b49e6f4c1157b903a6b60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 = \\log_4{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"87\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/1/08190008372cc068f4e3acc6215d58117f172bff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 = \\log_5{125}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"96\" height=\"19\" />, and by base of change formula, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/7/5975c1db3ec2e2af9588ebf30968b6d6c4d4c77a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_a{b} = \\frac{\\log_c{b}}{\\log_c{a}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"115\" height=\"44\" />. Lastly, notice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/c/9acf0610d37f3f02859dfb700ae5b54134cca871.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log a + \\log b = \\log ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"161\" height=\"16\" /> for all bases.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/2/c3203ffb0d20b3df9bdad20f769e3498fb5a716a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac 2{\\log_4{2000^6}} + \\frac 3{\\log_5{2000^6}} = \\log_{2000^6}{16} + \\log_{2000^6}{125} = \\log_{2000^6}{2000} = \\frac16 \\implies \\boxed{007} \\end{align*}\" width=\"643\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/e/66ee49eb9f271a3fcf93d66c65b0ff72400a9510.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bold{Solution}$\" width=\"75\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/b/68bc079b4182ec9f04ed97776cb562dd70ec4142.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bold{written}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/b/4eb4c07c2bb4bc2230f381d9b59c694201a72790.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bold{by}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>~ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/9/3b9c6fd462c13af35297f0dccb9e564e9810c470.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bold{PaperMath}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"106\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/f/c0f59f41c50cc2e7b6f559714270ddf8b14d6f85.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2}{\\log_4 2000^6} + \\frac{3}{\\log_5 2000^6}\\]\" width=\"182\" height=\"41\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/0/a2010c0f9a0d2e46148e4768849c17973e6338cb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\frac{1}{3\\log_4 2000} + \\frac{1}{2\\log_5 2000}\\]\" width=\"211\" height=\"41\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/4/364724a41482eee569ba9c404b2db6caeea93dd9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\frac{1}{3} \\log_{2000} 4 + \\frac{1}{2} \\log_{2000} 5\\]\" width=\"198\" height=\"37\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/0/a90aad578cbe2e20df261dcca66d795b43386802.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\log_{2000} (\\sqrt[3]{4} \\cdot \\sqrt{5}) = x\\]\" width=\"179\" height=\"21\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/5/ac57311666cd81ab860d993496d874bba7bfb813.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 2^{4x} \\cdot 5^{3x} = 2^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\cdot 5^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\]\" width=\"173\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/b/10b1ad337db4fea361c074117a44cf49e378a725.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 4x + (3\\log_2 5)x = \\frac{2}{3}+\\frac{1}{2} \\log_2 5\\]\" width=\"278\" height=\"37\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/9/7e91e5d153ec7e62c780f7d9429f0311fb47ba91.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies x = \\frac{\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{1}{2} \\log_2 5}{4 + 3\\log_2 5}\\]\" width=\"165\" height=\"45\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/f/b4fc5cefe0c27cdb5f01a72cf96312649ae0fc06.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 6x = \\frac{4 + 3\\log_2 5}{4 + 3\\log_2 5}\\]\" width=\"171\" height=\"42\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/9/ec972e25d384219345eee071968901b91d44c5c6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies x = \\frac{1}{6}\\]\" width=\"84\" height=\"37\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/a/89a5bc462dd852040c8351f4dd7438308c44e0f7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies m + n = \\boxed{007}\\]\" width=\"150\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~ <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Cxsmi\">cxsmi</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Pi Academy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ucn9yfcu1QY?si=r3ebuzJNd2uAq0kV\">https://youtu.be/ucn9yfcu1QY?si=r3ebuzJNd2uAq0kV</a>\n</p><p>~ Pi Academy\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II\" title=\"2000 AIME II\">2000 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2000\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2000 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\